# Weather collector for Routes 3-5 on talraviv-pcl (account ami). The server clock is Israel
# time (Asia/Jerusalem), not UTC as on edison; the collector itself works in UTC.
# Install with: crontab ~/voyage_collector/deploy/talraviv-pcl/collector.crontab
# (this replaces the account's crontab; check crontab -l first).

# Every 10 minutes: start the collector if it is not running (reboot, crash).
*/10 * * * * /home/ami/voyage_collector/deploy/talraviv-pcl/ensure_collector.sh

# Daily at 04:30 Israel time (01:30 or 02:30 UTC, between fetches): copy the archives to the
# lab NAS, mounted at /tsl-disk from /etc/fstab (2026-10-19). Uses edison's script with this
# machine's paths.
30 4 * * * SRC=/home/ami/voyage_collector/data/ DST=/tsl-disk/ami/voyage_weather_collector_backup_talraviv-pcl LOG=/home/ami/voyage_collector/data/backup.log /home/ami/voyage_collector/deploy/edison/backup_collector.sh
